    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'CONTROLS


    WASD / arrows: Move   |   Mouse: Look

    Left click:
    Shoot   |   R: Reload   |   G: Grenade

    E: Door / gold / rescue / escape

    1:
    Follow   2: Attack   3: Grenades

    4: Retreat   5: Hold position

    Tab:
    Unlock cursor and click squad buttons

    Esc: Pause   |   Left Shift: Run


    Robber
    escape route:

    Vault -> Bank rear door -> Back alley

    -> Sewer manhole
    -> Tunnel exit


    Health and supplies carry between scenes.'
